    <section class="main-content920">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-9 blog--top-part2892">
                    <div class="blog-part3903"> 
                       <img src="image/lions-806x440.jpg" alt="Image" class="img-responsive">
                        <div class="blog-details3902">
                            <h3><span><i class="fa fa-picture-o" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> Discovering the Majestic Lions: Kings of the Junglee</h3>
                            <hr>
                            <div class="ques-icon-info2933"> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-user" aria-hidden="true">Yap Ming Shen</i></a> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-calendar" aria-hidden="true">14 February, 2024</i></a> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-briefcase" aria-hidden="true"> work</i></a> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-comments-o" aria-hidden="true"> 56 comments</i></a> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-eye" aria-hidden="true"> 1,452 views</i></a> </div>
                            <p>Explore the fascinating world of lions, the majestic creatures that rule the savannah. Learn about their social structure, hunting tactics, and the challenges they face in the wild. Join us in uncovering the secrets of these magnificent beasts.</p>
                            <div class="continue-deatils738"> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-plus" aria-hidden="true"> Continue Reading</i></a> </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="blog-part3903"> <img src="image/owl-806x440.jpg" alt="Image" class="img-responsive">
                        <div class="blog-details3902">
                            <h3><span><i class="fa fa-picture-o" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> The Mysterious World of Owls: Nighttime Predators</h3>
                            <hr>
                            <div class="ques-icon-info2933"> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-user" aria-hidden="true">Yap Ming Shenn</i></a> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-calendar" aria-hidden="true"> August 8, 2023</i></a> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-briefcase" aria-hidden="true"> work</i></a> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-comments-o" aria-hidden="true"> 38 comments</i></a> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-eye" aria-hidden="true"> 2,115 views</i></a> </div>
                            <p>Dive into the nocturnal world of owls, understanding their unique adaptations for night hunting. Discover different owl species, their roles in ecosystem balance, and the mystique that surrounds these silent predators.</p>
                            <div class="continue-deatils738"> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-plus" aria-hidden="true"> Continue Reading</i></a> </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="blog-part3903"> <img src="image/dolphins-806x440.jpg" alt="Image" class="img-responsive">
                        <div class="blog-details3902">
                            <h3><span><i class="fa fa-picture-o" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> Swimming with Dolphins: Understanding Their Intelligence</h3>
                            <hr>
                            <div class="ques-icon-info2933"> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-user" aria-hidden="true">Yap Ming Shen</i></a> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-calendar" aria-hidden="true"> October 26, 2023</i></a> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-briefcase" aria-hidden="true"> work</i></a> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-comments-o" aria-hidden="true"> 82 comments</i></a> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-eye" aria-hidden="true"> 3,749 views</i></a> </div>
                            <p>Embark on an underwater journey to explore the intelligence and social behaviors of dolphins. Learn how these marine mammals communicate, form social bonds, and display complex problem-solving abilities that fascinate scientists and animal lovers alike.</p>
                            <div class="continue-deatils738"> 
                                <a href="#"><i class="fa fa-plus" aria-hidden="true"> Continue Reading</i></a> </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
